Lloyd Gilbert wrote:

> Chaotic: Huhetotl
> Neutral: Camaxtli
> Lawful: Quetzalcoatl (s,c)
> 
> Beyond indicating that I'm a lawful archeologist, what significance
> does the "(s,c)" bit have?

It's your (s)tarting as well as (c)urrent alignment. If you were to
convert to Camaxtli, for instance (not recommended until after the
Quest), you'd have 

Chaotic: Huhetotl
Neutral: Camaxtli (c)
Lawful: Quetzalcoatl (s)

indicating that your alignment started out lawful but is now neutral.

